                  <Edge From="56" To="57" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="57" To="58" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="59" To="60" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="60" To="61" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="61" To="62" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="63" To="64" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="64" To="65" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="65" To="66" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="67" To="68" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="69" To="68" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="70" To="71" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="71" To="68" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="68" To="72" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="72" To="73" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="73" To="74" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="75" To="76" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="77" To="76" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="78" To="79" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="79" To="76" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="76" To="80" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="81" To="80" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="80" To="82" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="82" To="83" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="83" To="84" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="86" To="87" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="87" To="88" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="89" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="85" To="86" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>TrialEnds</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>Optogenetics?</Name>
              <Description>Every trial of an optogenetics experiment has a condition, laser on or off; none without.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>laserCondition &gt; 0</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:CreateObservable">
              <Name>Laser</Name>
              <Description>One optogenetics trial's laser, the trials one after another (Concat), so the next is armed only once this one ends: Zapit sent the trial's StartStimulus (ArmZapit) and its reply checked (CheckZapitArmed: a refusal or the wrong condition stops the workflow); at the trial's trigger (its Go, or -laserToStimulusSeconds after it; SecondsUntil on the Harp clock) the ZapitTrigger line rises, unless the trial was answered first (UnlessAnswered: no laser, and the row logs laserPowerMw 0), and on a hardware-triggered rig only if Zapit has answered by then (RequireZapitArmed stops the workflow otherwise, never moving the trigger); the line falls laserDurationSeconds later, and the laser ends after the longest ramp-down (RampDown).</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
                    <Name>LaserTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>LaserTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="HardwareTriggered" Selector="Zapit.HardwareTriggered" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DurationSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.Optogenetics.LaserDurationSeconds" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>ArmZapit</Name>
                    <Description>The trial's StartStimulus (its condition, laser on with the task's power or off at 0 mW, timed for laserDurationSeconds). On a hardware-triggered rig (rig.yml's zapit.hardwareTriggered) sent as this trial's laser begins: at the start of its interval, or once the last trial's laser and ramp-down have ended if later. Without, Zapit starts the laser on receipt, so it is sent at the trigger (RequireZapitArmed's output).</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:ZapitTrialCommand">
                      <p1:HardwareTriggered>false</p1:HardwareTriggered>
                      <p1:DurationSeconds>0</p1:DurationSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitCommands</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitReplies</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
                    <Name>StartStimulusReply?</Name>
                    <Workflow>
                      <Nodes>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                          <Name>Source1</Name>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                          <scr:Expression>CommandCode == 1</scr:Expression>
                        </Expression>
                        <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                      </Nodes>
                      <Edges>
                        <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                        <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                      </Edges>
                    </Workflow>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                      <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>LaserTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:CheckZapitArmed" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>LaserTrial</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TrialGo</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:TrialGoFor" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:SecondsUntil">
                      <p1:Moment>LaserTrigger</p1:Moment>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="InputMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="Item2" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                    <Selector>Item1</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>Trigger</Name>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:RequireZapitArmed">
                    <p1:HardwareTriggered>false</p1:HardwareTriggered>
                  </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitTriggerLine</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitLineMessage">
                      <zap:Set>true</zap:Set>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>BehaviorBoardFeed</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>LaserDuration</Name>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.0</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="DueSeconds" Selector="TaskParameters.Optogenetics.LaserDurationSeconds" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>ZapitTriggerLine</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
                    <Selector>Item2</Selector>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Combinator xsi:type="zap:ZapitLineMessage">
                      <zap:Set>false</zap:Set>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
                    <Name>BehaviorBoardFeed</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>RampDown</Name>
                    <Description>The longest ramp-down a Zapit conditions file may have (lib-open-rigs ZapitConditions.MaximumRampDownMs, TrialDraw.ZapitRampDownSeconds): Zapit refuses the next StartStimulus until it has played.</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="core:HarpDelay">
                      <core:DueSeconds>0.5</core:DueSeconds>
                    </Combinator>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>Timestamp</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                  <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
                    <Name>UnlessAnswered</Name>
                    <Description>No laser on a trial answered before its trigger (a trigger after the stimulus, Pip 13 Nov 2026): the trial records whichever of its trigger and its outcome came first, and its row logs laserPowerMw 0 from the same record.</Description>
                    <Combinator xsi:type="p1:UnlessAnswered" />
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
                    <PropertyMappings>
                      <Property Name="HardwareTriggered" Selector="Zapit.HardwareTriggered" />
                    </PropertyMappings>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
                    <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
                  </Expression>
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="3" To="8" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="5" To="4" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="4" To="8" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="7" To="6" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source4" />
                  <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="14" To="13" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="13" To="15" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="16" To="18" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="21" To="23" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="23" To="42" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="42" To="24" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="15" To="24" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="26" To="25" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="25" To="27" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="27" To="28" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="30" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="31" To="30" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="33" To="30" Label="Source3" />
                  <Edge From="30" To="34" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="35" To="34" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="34" To="36" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="36" To="37" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="37" To="38" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="30" To="39" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="40" To="39" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="39" To="41" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="24" To="8" Label="Source2" />
                  <Edge From="44" To="43" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="43" To="24" Label="Source3" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Concat" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>SpeakerArray</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Name>CheckTaskAtGo</Name>
              <Description>The task checked at Go (TrialDraw.CheckTask, tested C#): a stage past the table, a target modality with no trials or a laser that would outlast the next trigger stops the workflow here, before the first trial.</Description>
              <Combinator xsi:type="p1:CheckTaskAtGo" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TaskConfig</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrainingStage</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Zip" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
              <Name>SpoutMovements?</Name>
              <Description>Trial 1 starts with the spouts out, as every later trial does after the last one's drink; a stage without spout movements (habituation) keeps them in.</Description>
              <Workflow>
                <Nodes>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
                    <Name>Source1</Name>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
                    <scr:Expression>Item2.TaskParameters.TrainingStages[Item3].SpoutMovements</scr:Expression>
                  </Expression>
                  <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
                </Nodes>
                <Edges>
                  <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
                  <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
                </Edges>
              </Workflow>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dev:ToLickSpoutCommand">
                <dev:Command>SpoutsOut</dev:Command>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStageFeed</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>VisualStimulusOffFeed</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>VisualStimulusOff</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStageFeed</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>BehaviorBoardFeed</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>BehaviorBoard-Main.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>TrialGo</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Name>RngSeed</Name>
              <Description>The seed the trials are drawn with (the task file's rngSeed, or one drawn when it is null), once, at trial 1's Go, as a BonsaiData_Async event.</Description>
              <Selector>rngSeed</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="orl:CreateAsyncEvent">
                <orl:Event>RngSeed</orl:Event>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="Bonsai.Harp:WithLatestTimestamp.bonsai">
              <Name>Timestamp</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>AsyncEvents</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="4" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="11" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="12" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="18" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="18" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="15" To="18" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="16" To="18" Label="Source4" />
            <Edge From="17" To="18" Label="Source5" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="21" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="22" To="24" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="24" To="25" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="25" To="26" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="27" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="27" To="28" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="28" To="29" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="30" To="34" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="31" To="34" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="32" To="33" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="33" To="34" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="34" To="35" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="38" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="36" To="38" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="37" To="38" Label="Source3" />
            <Edge From="38" To="39" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="39" To="40" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="40" To="41" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="42" To="2" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="43" To="44" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="45" To="46" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="47" To="48" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="49" To="50" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="50" To="51" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="51" To="52" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="52" To="53" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="53" To="54" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="lv:StreamDevices">
        <Name>LiveView</Name>
        <Description>Streams every device in this machine's rig.yml that the workflow publishes, over ZeroMQ, for the live view (OpenRigs.LiveView): data on TCP 5556, video on 5558, from Start, in ready mode too. The three cameras as Camera-Face/Pupil/Body.video, 5 JPEG frames a second at 320 x 240, and the Behavior board's encoder from BehaviorBoard-Main.Data, 10 a second; each rate and size can be changed in rig.yml under the device's liveView:. Also elapsed, seconds since the experiment folder appeared, and liveview, this workflow and its commit. Every message carries the rig and the session key, ready until the experiment folder exists. Last in the workflow, because it streams only subjects built before it. A port already in use stops the workflow at Start.</Description>
        <lv:ConfigRoot>C:\Coen-Lab-Local\RigConfigs</lv:ConfigRoot>
        <lv:DataPort>5556</lv:DataPort>
        <lv:VideoPort>5558</lv:VideoPort>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
